20. ✅ Goal: Design a Serverless API Backend on AWS

“Serverless” means:

You don’t manage servers or OS
AWS manages scaling, availability, and infrastructure
You focus mainly on business logic
Your main building blocks:
API Gateway → Entry point (HTTP/REST API)

Auth (Cognito / Lambda Authorizer) → Who is calling?
