🎯 Example: E-commerce Orders API (Serverless on AWS)
👉 Imagine you are building a backend for an app like a mini Amazon.

Users can:

Login
View orders
Place orders
🔹 Overall Architecture
4
🔁 Step-by-Step Flow (Real Example)
🧑 Step 1: User Login
User logs in via app
Auth handled by Amazon Cognito

👉 Cognito returns:
JWT Token (access token)

🌐 Step 2: Client Calls API

User wants to see orders:
